            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darkness Ahead</strong> is an adventure game about a man searching for his missing younger brother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set on a remote plateau between the mountains, the journey leads through abandoned locations hiding a dark secret from the past. Search for clues, solve puzzles, overcome dangerous obstacles, and survive supernatural events as you uncover what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned buildings to find useful tools, gather everything you need, and piece together the mystery one clue at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles.</p></li></ul>",
